<h1 class="nm-h1" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;line-height:34px;font-weight:600;color:#1B2B4B;">
  Welcome, {{firstName}}.
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Your Nenjam Matrimony account is ready. We built this for people who are serious about
  finding a life partner — so the more complete your profile, the better your matches.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:600;color:#1B2B4B;">Three things worth doing first</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="margin:0 0 8px;">
  <tr><td style="padding:6px 0;color:#4B5563;">1. Add photos — profiles with photos get far more interest.</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:6px 0;color:#4B5563;">2. Set your partner preferences so we can narrow the field.</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:6px 0;color:#4B5563;">3. Verify your profile to earn the trust badge.</td></tr>
</table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="nm-cta" style="margin:26px 0 8px;">
  <tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#1B2B4B" style="border-radius:8px;">
    <a href="{{appUrl}}/profile" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Complete your profile</a>
  </td></tr>
</table>
